    "displayName": "Repair Editor",
    "spawnerPrompt": "Repairs exact validation diagnostics or stable reviewer finding IDs. May only make finding-scoped edits and must not perform unrelated cleanup. Requires a versioned `handoff` with schemaVersion 1, taskId, objective, at least one finding, and explicit permissions.",
